msgstr "Feed authentication diagnostic"

msgid "plugins.generic.googleBooks.authDiagnosticDescription"
msgstr "Safe status from the most recent authenticated feed request. No username, password, Authorization value, or password hash is stored in this diagnostic. Saving feed settings clears the previous result."

